  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The sole legitimate heir of the Hwasin Group. Jung E-Geon. He's sick of his family trying to marry him off to the girl who saved his life as a child. But his interest lies elsewhere—in Ha Yeon-Ju, the family's secret and shame. The shadow-like Ha Yeon-Ju begins to irritate him. He proposed a contract relationship to deceive his family, using her, but finds himself increasingly fixated on her...\n\n *“I suppose I was the one who wavered. Not you, Ha Yeon-Ju.”*\n\nThe man, leaning on the table with his chin resting on his hand, frowned and smiled bitterly.\n\n *“So, let's date. Ha Yeon-Ju.”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
